# L §5.11: "Refusals outrank holes: when both reach a result, the result is refused."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

input h: int
input zero: int
input one: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  h = ?"unknown"
  zero = 0
  one = 1

ask q1: h + one / zero
=== expect
q1: refused: RUN-DIV ...
  cut 2026-12-31
